    activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can Special Summon 1 "Solfachord"
    card with an odd Pendulum Scale from your Pendulum Zone to your zone this card
    points to, and if you do, negate the activation, then you can add 1 "Solfachord"
    Pendulum Monster with an even Pendulum Scale from your Deck to your face-up Extra
    Deck.'
